    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bana betu, tudi tunusengelela bua dilua dia Mukelenge wetu Yesu Kilisto ne bua kusangishibua kuetu kudiye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bua nuenu kanuzakashibu lubilu mu meshi enu, ne kanutshinyishibu, nasha bua nyuma nasha bua dî nasha bua mukanda udibo badingila ne ngua kutudi ne, Dituku dia Mukelenge dikadi aha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu kanudingi muanda wonso; bua dituku adi kadiena dilua anu bialua ditombokela dia Nzambi diambedi, ne anu biabuluibua muntu wa buhidia, muana wa dibutuka mene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye ngudi udimanyika ne udi udibandisha ku mpala kua bionso bidi bidikibua ne, Nzambi, anyi bionso bidi bantu batendelela; nunku yeye udi ushikama mu ntempelo wa Nzambi udilesha kudi bantu ne, Meme ndi Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanuena nuvuluka ne nakadi nuambila malu â hanakatshidi munkatshi muenu, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katataka nudi bamanye bualu budi bumukanda bua yeye abuluibue mu tshikondo tshiandi tshine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua bualu busokoka bua buhidia butshidi buenza mudimu wabu, kadi mukuabo udiku udi mmukanda katataka tô ne humushibueye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe muntu wa buhidia neabuluibue, udi Mukelenge Yesu ulua kushiha ne muhuya wa mukana muandi, neamuvuishe bu tshintu tshia tshianana ku dimueneka dia kulua kuandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulua kuandi kudi bu mudi kuenzesha kua Satana, ne bukole buonso, ne bimanyinu, ne malu a kukema a mashimi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne kudinga kuonso kua malu mabi kudi batshidi bajimina mu lufu; bualu bua kabakitabusha dinanga dia bualu bulelela bua bobo basungidibue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua bualu ebu Nzambi udi ubatumina dienzesha dia dihambuka, bua bobo bitabushe mashimi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bua bonso balumbuluishibue badi kabai bitabusha malu a bushua, kadi badi ne disanka mu malu mabi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi butudi nʼabu mbua kusakidila Nzambi misangu yonso bua bualu buenu, bana betu banangibua kudi Mukelenge, bualu bua Nzambi wakadianjila kunusungula ku tshibangidilu bua kunuha luhandu mu kujidila kua Nyuma Muimpe ne mu kuitabusha kua malu a bushua; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakanubikilamu bua lumu luimpe lutuakunuambila, bua nuenu nuhete butumbi bua Mukelenge wetu Yesu Kilisto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku bana betu, nudijadike bimpe, nulamate ku bilele biamba kudi bantu biakanuyishabo, nasha ku mei etu nasha ku mukanda wetu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wetu Yesu Kilisto muine ne Nzambi Tatu wetu, wakatunanga ne wakatuha busambi bua tshiendelele ne ditekemena dimpe bua ngasa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anusambe mitshima yenu, aijadike mu mudimu muimpe wonso ne mu dî dimpe dionso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
